sentences.text:
The petitioner is directed to be enlarged on bail in S.C.No.10009/2023 pending before the Court of IV Addl. District & Sessions Judge,
Doddaballapura arising out of Crime No.48/2023 registered by the Doddabelavangala Police Station, Bengaluru District for the offences punishable under Sections 498A & 304B of IPC, subject to the following conditions:
a) Petitioner shall execute personal bond for a sum of Rs.1,00,000/- (Rupees One lakhs only) with one surety for the NC: 2023:KHC:39982 likesum, to the satisfaction of the jurisdictional Court;
b) The petitioner shall appear regularly on all the dates of hearing before the Trial Court unless the Trial Court exempts his appearance for valid reasons;
c) The petitioner shall not directly or indirectly threaten or tamper with the prosecution witnesses;
 d) The petitioner shall not leave the  jurisdiction of the Trial Court without permission of the said Court until the case registered against him is disposed off.
SD/-
